    "body": "Triage: `P3`, `bug`, `area:ui`, `effort:medium`.\n\nWhy: a user reports it. The pick works; the dropdown shows the wrong source, so the message misleads. The workaround is to read the toolpath or re-open the panel. One property-panel control follows a known pattern, so `effort:medium`.\n\nRelated work, not a duplicate: #2848 (rotary operations ignore face selection) and #2970 (Rotary Parallel leaves a band uncut). A fix should check whether the source field and the actual source part from one place.\n",
